# Docs conventions

- Product decisions → `khan-parent-consent-zalo-plan.md` (+ lịch sử thay đổi)
- Architecture / ADR → `02-technical-architecture.md`
- Phase 1 tasks → `01-phase1-detail.md`
- Living board → `03-phase-progress.md` (Status: todo|doing|blocked|done)
- Do not delete phase history; append nhật ký
- When scope changes, update overview + progress blockers
